  "name": "transcribing-slack-audio",
  "description": "Transcribe a Slack voice message or audio attachment (M4A, MP3, OGG/Opus, WAV, WebM) on the local machine with ffmpeg and whisper.cpp, so the agent can act on what the user said. Use when a Slack message carries an audio file, the prompt names Slack audio attachments, or the user asks what a voice message or recording says. Covers finding the file, running the bundled script, the duration and time limits, and how to report a failed transcription. Audio stays on the machine and is never sent to an external transcription service.",
